    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rooney Auctioneers are delighted to present Naomh Antoin, Ballysimon, Limerick. This large, 4 bed detached residence sits on approx .5 acres of landscaped gardens, along with a number of garages and sheds.  \r\n\r\nInside, the property features four well proportioned double bedrooms, two bathrooms, a kitchen / dining room and a separate living room. To the side, a separate garage with private access allows the new owners convert to a bedroom or separate living room.\r\nLocated just off the Ballysimon Road, Naomh Antoin is less than 1km to the M7 and right around the corner from Morrisons Bar & Kitchen, and the new Leo’s Cafe. \r\n\r\nThis property is not subject to a rent cap - Built in 1974."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\nLarge, bright entrance hall connecting to the living room, kitchen, bathrooms and all bedrooms.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room - 4.17m x 3.18m + 3.39m x 2.87m\r\nLarge bright kitchen / dining room with views to the private rear garden. Fully fitted kitchen with gas hob and integrated appliances.\r\n\r\nSide Room - 4.67m x 3.79m\r\nLocated by the side access door in the kitchen with great potential for change of use.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 4.74m x 3.24m\r\nSeparate living room with glass sliding door to rear garden.\r\n\r\nBathroom 1 - 2.25m x 0.72m\r\nW.C., W.H.B., Shower Cubical\r\n\r\nBathroom 2 - 2.30m x 1.97m\r\nW.C., H.W.B., Jacuzzi Bath Tub\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.07m x 3.41\r\nPrimary bedroom with dual aspect windows to the west of the property.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.38m x 3.38m\r\nDouble bedroom with views to the side of the property\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 -3.60m x 2.31m\r\nDouble bedroom with views to the side of the property.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 3.48m x 2.56\r\nDouble bedroom Views to the front of the property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Large Private Back Garden\r\nExcellent Location\r\nLarge Landscaped Driveway\r\nVarious Sheds\r\nOil Fired Central Heating"
      },
